  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOPS - Ukraine Transition Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to enhance the safety and resilience of communities in Mykolaiv city and region by assisting the local authorities in providing critical equipment and infrastructure support. The Mykolaiv region has sustained significant damage to its social infrastructure due to the ongoing war, affecting educational and healthcare facilities, as well as other public service buildings, including individual houses. The project will focus on the following:

- Complete restoration of Arkas Gymnasium 
- Repair of Snihurivka Lyceum 
- Procurement of specialized equipment for Mykolaiv city and region authorities
- Provision of capacity building activities to support the effective procurement, operation and maintenance of specialised equipment.</narrative>
  </description>
